{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0cdb14c923aff381b09454e4d34094093fd60a38a1930509fc7d598983c0820b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["清除淫亂之罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我聽說在你們當中竟有人與繼母亂倫。這種淫亂的事，就是連異教徒都做不出來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們竟然還自高自大！難道你們不該痛心，把做這事的人從你們當中趕出去嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["現在，我雖然身在遠方，心卻在你們那裡。我已經審判了做這事的人，就像親自在場一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你們奉我們主耶穌的名聚會時，我的心並我們主耶穌的權能也與你們同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你們要把這人交給撒旦去毀壞他的肉體，好使這人的靈魂在主耶穌再來的日子可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們自誇不是好事，豈不知一點麵酵能使整團麵發起來嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你們要把舊酵除掉，好成為真正無酵的新麵團，因為我們逾越節的羔羊基督已經被獻為祭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以，我們不可帶著歹毒邪惡的舊酵守這逾越節，而要用純潔真誠的無酵餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我以前曾經寫信吩咐你們，不可與淫亂的人交往。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我的意思並不是指世上所有淫亂、貪婪、欺詐與祭拜偶像的人。那樣的話，你們將不得不離開這個世界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我的意思是，若有人自稱是信徒，卻淫亂、貪婪、祭拜偶像、毀謗、酗酒、欺詐，你們不要和他們交往，甚至不要和他們一起吃飯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["審判教會以外的人與我何干？然而，教會裡面的人豈不是該由你們審判嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝自會審判教會以外的人，你們要把那邪惡的人從你們當中趕出去。",{"noteId":8}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"申命記13·15；17·7；19·19；21·21；22·21、24；24·7。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}